{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:4","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":4,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"這裡懸掛的是「時代織錦(Tapestry of Ages)」。這件魔法織品講述了聖者(Avatar)的故事，從黑暗時代、美德時代，一直到預言未來的這個啟蒙時代(Age of Enlightenment)。","source_sha256":"cbcf972fa5965eb02478083df670c8ec4e433085c3d863918379be97a76f1e44","source_units":193,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
