{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:17","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":17,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"托爾金全集\r\n\r\n本套書收錄：\r\n《哈比人》\r\n《魔戒》\r\n《雙城奇謀》\r\n《王者再臨》\r\n《精靈寶鑽》\r\n《聖誕老爸的來信》\r\n","source_sha256":"a456fa52c9f40f1764190ce86058ce50c849cdadb192166e2dc4529c903f2c6c","source_units":196,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:19","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":19,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"石像鬼(Gargoyle)傳說考\r\n作者：老諾立克\r\n\r\n雖然多數人認為石像鬼族(Gargoyles)只是傳說，但許多城堡上裝飾的石像鬼「雕像」究竟從何而來，至今沒有任何紀錄可考。就連終極智慧法典(Codex)那些高聳的石造守衛，也具備許多「傳說中」石像鬼的外貌特徵，而同樣沒有人知道它們從何而來。儘管缺乏確切的證據，仍有相當多未經證實的目擊報告，聲稱見過活生生的石像鬼。筆者認為，惡魔其實是石像鬼的一種。既然多部學術著作中都記載了許多可信的惡魔遭遇事件，或許那正是進一步了解石像鬼的最佳資料來源。\r\n\r\n","source_sha256":"ed9024a742939eb3426208d874260e818d6a9d3124190cfbbccac576c15fadd0","source_units":766,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:20","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":20,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"愛麗絲夢遊仙境\r\n作者：路易斯．卡羅\r\n\r\n有一天，愛麗絲看見一隻奇怪的白兔。牠一面看著懷錶，一面擔心自己遲到了。愛麗絲追著牠跳進兔子洞，往下掉了好長一段距離，發現自己來到一個奇異的國度。她在那裡參加了一場茶會，同席的有瘋帽匠和睡鼠。她還遇見了一隻古怪的毛毛蟲，以及一隻會消失的貓――最後才消失的是牠的笑容。紅心皇后大喊：「砍掉她的頭！」衛兵們衝上前要抓愛麗絲――就在這時她醒了過來，才發現原來一切都是一場夢。\r\n","source_sha256":"b2364c5764a93bd0bf3e871efba510f0dbfb16dae569732be2b2ff78b25ea461","source_units":566,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:21","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":21,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"包德溫的烘焙大全\r\n\r\n或許有人會對此嗤之以鼻，但製作麵包、糕點、派餅與蛋糕，可是人生中最崇高的志業之一。仔細研讀本書，有朝一日你或許就能擔起這份重大的責任。\r\n","source_sha256":"12189bbf9e7fb9c4ddd066686106cfd6d4757051469a5b29119cf7e41b91d3e2","source_units":256,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:22","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":22,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"弓術要訣\r\n作者：伊歐洛・菲茨歐文(Iolo Fitzowen)\r\n\r\n射得好，自有其禪意。與你的弓合而為一。拋開心中一切雜念，只想著隨箭矢飛去、命中目標，你便不會失手。\r\n","source_sha256":"486fabb4df69632a997f05c3128a88d0e45a2f7838c620d622619a412ef9eabc","source_units":209,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
