{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:24","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":24,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"劇作選集\r\n作者：雷蒙多\r\n\r\n這本舞台劇選集收錄了多部傑作，例如《三人一褲襠》、《聖者(Avatar)的試煉》、《剽竊者》、《線索》、《倒讚》，以及其他幾部得獎作品。為了方便演出，書末還附有幾種建議的服裝與化妝技巧。\r\n","source_sha256":"ab32f541aea88a5179a4778ca68a244babf2a881b1ff7973b836b82a80b7f72b","source_units":332,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:25","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":25,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"迪爾札的良言年鑑\r\n\r\n賭博是付出代價卻一無所獲的最可靠方法。\r\n做成的小事，勝過計畫中的大事。\r\n千萬別跟半人馬下雙陸棋。\r\n\r\n","source_sha256":"fa2571d36a885c23fdaf5e6f3fbb41bebe97b21d9434de7543a52f16fe2429a5","source_units":195,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:26","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":26,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"不列顛尼亞百科全書\r\n第二卷：F－L\r\n\r\n這是一套長篇系列叢書中的又一卷，詳載所有已知的地理位置與歷史人物。本卷從爬蟲類的古代賢者法爾加開始，一直到如今屬於月光城(Moonglow)一部分的著名圖書館理學苑(Lycaeum)為止。\r\n","source_sha256":"7262a5a7ea514374d4de17461e41157026239a6fea0711beabea28ba5432b0d0","source_units":291,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:27","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":27,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"不列顛尼亞百科全書\r\n第一卷：A－E\r\n\r\n這是一套長篇系列叢書中的又一卷，詳載所有已知的地理位置與歷史人物。本卷從特林錫克(Trinsic)的首任鎮長阿卡拉開始，一直到蒙丹(Mondain)與敏娜絲(Minax)的邪惡子嗣艾克索達斯(Exodus)為止。\r\n","source_sha256":"088639be44187d7cf4a025820d6dfeb505d9f3064d64bdc7b4bba09360707750","source_units":266,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:28","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":28,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"不列顛尼亞百科全書\r\n第三卷：M－P\r\n\r\n這是一套長篇系列叢書中的又一卷，詳載所有已知的地理位置與歷史人物。本卷從古代紫杉城(Yew)的歷史古塔卡諾斯開始，一直到首創罕用「第四人稱」觀點的普斯莫蘭為止。\r\n","source_sha256":"1a97c19a19ab89ce3d85aae55a6034c81e5d5607afdcd8af34a7c832a25687d8","source_units":306,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:29","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":29,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"不列顛尼亞百科全書\r\n第四卷：Q－U\r\n\r\n這是一套長篇系列叢書中的又一卷，詳載所有已知的地理位置與歷史人物。本卷從北方神話中的雪怪寬塞特洛尼康開始，一直到「烏托邦」為止――那是將自古以來的完美社會理念付諸實現的構想。\r\n\r\n","source_sha256":"91e5b71af17f7d3ff4f0171f2462758476d8572b4a57be9c02cc13d78a6c461a","source_units":337,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:30","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":30,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"不列顛尼亞百科全書\r\n第五卷：V－Z\r\n\r\n這是一套長篇系列叢書中的又一卷，詳載所有已知的地理位置與歷史人物。本卷從當代說書人兼傳奇寓言編纂者瓦爾加茲開始，一直到史前島嶼齊安德為止。\r\n","source_sha256":"c84a91c321e4908b2a2993dcb06dbca67b07d200cb6c135a3674d30aa42e7d6f","source_units":287,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
