{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:32","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":32,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"我是石像鬼(Gargoyle)\r\n作者：達洛克\r\n\r\n這是一部引人入勝的小說，描寫一名人類假扮成石像鬼，從石像鬼的角度體驗他們的生活。故事巧妙融合了歷史與趣聞，內容取材自與許多石像鬼的接觸經驗。全書特別強調石像鬼家庭結構的重要性。\r\n\r\n既然沒有證據顯示石像鬼有性別之分，「父親」石像鬼與他們（想必是收養的）兒子之間關係如此親密，實在耐人尋味。這種態度，似乎與較聰明的有翼種(Winged)石像鬼對待無翼種(Wingless)的方式相似：帶著幾分居高臨下，卻仍有關懷之情，彷彿無翼者是需要有翼者保護、照看的孩子。\r\n","source_sha256":"67f4230bb0081b2af63a5f8147eca3e91d2482c3204aa2e2d0724f33c18bb270","source_units":769,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:33","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":33,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"隨鬼火而逝\r\n作者：瑪格麗塔．米契利諾\r\n\r\n據稱這部小說出自一位年輕的吉普賽(Gypsies)女子之手，描繪了不列顛尼亞(Britannia)的黃金歲月。書中充滿米契利諾聲稱來自她族人的短篇軼事，讀來十分有趣。\r\n","source_sha256":"a10b5b11a604ace2a28ab30b94f4845c9a887806b5ced681260f871387b466b8","source_units":240,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:34","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":34,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"死亡如何影響經常與之為伍的人\r\n\r\n第一天：受試者（提爾瑞）看來頗為友善，願意接受我的陪伴。\r\n第二天：受試者表現出古怪的幽默感，非常病態。\r\n第三天：未與受試者接觸。\r\n第四天：受試者不斷提起最近與墓園「住戶」的談話。\r\n第五天：……\r\n","source_sha256":"4eddb3afc4345e0a594ef41e7ab4c86b8230c1a039bea37e01c15752f8169d15","source_units":338,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:35","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":35,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"卡蓮娜(Karenna)的孕婦健身操\r\n作者：卡蓮娜(Karenna)\r\n\r\n書中收錄了許多適用於孕婦格鬥與運動的智慧之言。附錄的插圖詳盡地說明了這些招式與傳統招式的差異，以及懷孕究竟如何影響格鬥技巧。\r\n","source_sha256":"2af0a7b6157691bc91f825c9d8d8c99cc254098a7a14612fed4ad67c76d1fac2","source_units":309,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:36","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":36,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"卡蓮娜(Karenna)的全身健身操\r\n作者：卡蓮娜(Karenna)\r\n\r\n這本格鬥與運動訓練手冊的內容，是在初版的基礎上加以擴充。可惜的是，這本書受到的關注遠不如卡蓮娜(Karenna)的另外兩本著作。\r\n\r\n","source_sha256":"31377a554ad7ac8e94de517ffc26c609e9daadd9e7adc24d8823ab40cae46c8a","source_units":237,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:37","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":37,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"卡蓮娜(Karenna)的健身操\r\n作者：卡蓮娜(Karenna)\r\n\r\n這本樸素裝訂的書是一本格鬥與運動訓練手冊。書中以簡單而完整的插圖示範各種招式，不僅能制伏對手，還有助於促進心肺循環。\r\n","source_sha256":"b2933667844da95d81c26a2b5b36365e8379e055c5695c6566d075fe90bba1fb","source_units":288,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:38","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":38,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"黑門破解祕笈\r\n\r\n這本書所裝訂的書頁中，收錄了來自 Origin Systems 這個珍貴來源、詳實記載的破關提示。\r\n","source_sha256":"6fba3c485414a83ff4dd8f72715dd00c1e71cb91ed53c0478cdeb77e97cf1503","source_units":147,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:39","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":39,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"傳奇騎士 第一卷\r\n\r\n很久以前，阿什塔拉瑞亞王國爆發了一場大戰。有一段時間，邪惡勢力似乎將要得勝，但在全國最偉大的騎士塞加利昂(Seggallion)英勇奮戰之下，黑暗領主皮爾達的軍隊終於被擊退、擊潰。此後天下太平了一段時日，但多年之後，皮爾達再度坐大。他在黑暗之塔中策劃邪惡的陰謀，成功擄走了公爵，連偉大的騎士塞加利昂(Seggallion)也一併落入他手中。最大的敵人既已除去，他便準備再次展開征服之戰。在那動盪的年代，一群偉大的英雄崛起了。歷經許多艱險的冒險之後，他們終於攻入關押塞加利昂(Seggallion)的牢獄，將他救出。接著，他們出發去查明公爵的下落……\r\n\r\n","source_sha256":"5967139108433aeac91410f806b9fad964d23d56e19a10b2e146481a240c900b","source_units":816,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:40","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":40,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9 book draft","terms":[],"target":"`f5{{gargish:1}}`p\r\n`f1\r\n管理之書\r\n（譯文）\r\n自無數世代以來，我們有翼者一直領導著無翼者。這是正當而合宜的。但我們必須時時記住，他們的價值絲毫不亞於我們。沒有頭的身體無法行動，但沒有腿的身體同樣無法行動。若要成就任何事，全體必須齊心協力。所以，要引導無翼者，讓他們遠離歧途。但引導時，務必懷著尊重。\r\n","source_sha256":"cb1a6010f1f0e2edc3484d4597a8714683d2e8a4e336fc26588e1f55cba4252f","source_units":740,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:182","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":182,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":"Actual readable bedroom book; preserve original CRLF and page marker sequence","notes":"P6-S2 showcase draft; runtime route P9-4 (UTF-16 BOM storage + book plan), confirmed in game","terms":[],"target":"閱讀書籍的方法\r\n\r\n讀書是充實自我、享受樂趣的消遣。閱讀得越多，你就越能了解這個世界、居民與歷史。\r\n`p\r\n書中也藏著你可能忽略的線索。開啟書本後，用滑鼠左鍵點一下右上角折起的頁角，就能翻到下一頁。若要回到第一頁，點一下書籤即可。\r\n`p\r\n用滑鼠左鍵點一下左上角折起的頁角，可以翻回上一頁。閱讀完畢後，按 Esc，或在書本上任意位置按滑鼠右鍵，就能關閉書本。","source_sha256":"b5a04c84c115a6fb062742df015035882ade1f7398eb04f39e85f4c9144dafb2","source_units":637,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":"translation/showcase/reading-books.zh-TW.json"}
{"key":"BOOKS-EN.FLX:233","resource":"BOOKS-EN.FLX","entry_id":233,"status":"draft","category":"book","speaker":null,"context":null,"notes":"P9-4 book PoC draft","terms":[],"target":"---------------------\r\n裝備物品\r\n\r\n---------------------\r\n\t有許多東西你會想隨身攜帶，有些則只需直接使用。你的工具腰帶、衣服、背包、日誌和指南針都必須隨身攜帶。\r\n`p\t要攜帶物品，請用滑鼠左鍵點住它，拖曳到自己身上後放開。若只想使用物品，直接在原處用滑鼠左鍵點擊即可。\r\n\t有些物品既可以拿取，也可以使用。例如，用滑鼠左鍵點擊食物就能吃掉它；也可以用左鍵點住後拖曳到背包或工具腰帶上，留待之後再用。","source_sha256":"e962f1cc5108dfef1389d6f7010c7a6a96b16dbe6c640273092dedc8d2918ff2","source_units":585,"review":{"terminology":false,"language":false,"runtime":false},"runtime_supported":null,"runtime_evidence":[],"migrated_from":null}
